      ],
      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "@Inject HEAD (cancellable) of AbstractEntityTracker.update (Duplicationless 1.21.1-1.2.1): nothing is queued for a dimension nobody has asked about; @Inject HEAD of chunkSections (every query passes it): the first question about a dimension builds it from every entity in the level's entity sections (hidden included; ServerLevel.entityManager / ClientLevel.entityStorage -> sectionStorage -> sections, read by reflection) through the tracker's own update() and drainUpdateTasks(), other dimensions' queued tasks set aside and put back in order; @Inject RETURN of reset: the built dimensions are forgotten. The mode (lazy or as shipped) is decided per tracker at its first use. Trade-off (off by default): in the tick of a dimension's first question the answers already include that tick's joins, leaves and moves; entities the shipped tracker dropped when their chunk stopped being tracked are listed again if still loaded at the first question. Runtime flag duplicationlessLazyTracker. Helper bons.furious.patch.duplicationless_coo49.LazyTracker.",
      "license": "Duplicationless (MIT): no code carried",
      "kind": "change"
    }
